                                                "sense_id": "13906b8a-feb2-3506-800a-bdef505d7a60",
                                                "text": "It created inter-city and intermodal services, which were genuinely world leading. And it undeniably pushed British Railways into the modern era."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
